pe String. Separately, an enumeration 'VehicleSize' is defined, listing the=
 possible vehicle sizes as SMALL, MEDIUM, and LARGE.  The diagram shows a r=
elationship where the 'Vehicle' interface defines the common behavior for a=
ll vehicle types, and the classes implement this behavior, while the 'Vehic=
leSize' enum provides a type for representing the size of a vehicle." loadi=
