<h3 id=3D"ticket">Ticket</h3>
<p>The Ticket class represents a parking ticket generated when a vehicle en=
ters the parking lot. It keeps track of when a vehicle arrives and leaves, =
using these times to calculate duration, and links the vehicle to its assig=
ned spot.</p>
